   itmartin.dk (.hj-head-photo). The head box needs the class bs-head-me. *@
<span class="hj-head-photo"><img src="@_photo.Src" alt="@_photo.Place" width="150" height="150" /><span class="hj-head-place">@_photo.Place</span></span>

